Subject: [PATCH] fixup! wallet(v2): replace Berkeley DB with SQLite and native
 transaction providers

Update only the deterministic299 commitment in the legacy/descriptors wallet assumeutxo fixture. Both produced snapshots match every23603 byte and SHA703efab of the independently reconstructed299 fixture; preserve every wallet backup/load/restart/rescan/balance assertion. Both variants pass after the separately owned authenticated native bootstrap,8.93s total; stale expected commitment fails both before.

Tier: V2 (fixup to wallet(v2): replace Berkeley DB with SQLite and native transaction providers)
